        "{a} is on {band}, which the radio of {b} does not offer (it has {bands}).": "{a} está en {band}, que la radio de {b} no ofrece (tiene {bands}).",
        "{a} is on {band}, but its own radio has only {bands}.": "{a} está en {band}, pero su propia radio solo tiene {bands}.",
        "{a} and {b} have no band in common: {a} has {bandsA}, {b} has {bandsB}.": "{a} y {b} no tienen ninguna banda en común: {a} tiene {bandsA}, {b} tiene {bandsB}.",
        "{a} is set to {ssid}, but {b} does not broadcast it.": "{a} está asignado a {ssid}, pero {b} no la emite.",
        "{a} is on {ssid} on {band}, but {b} broadcasts {ssid} only on {bands}.": "{a} está en {ssid} en {band}, pero {b} emite {ssid} solo en {bands}.",
        "{a} is on {ssid}, whose subnet is {cidr}, but its address {ip} is not in it.": "{a} está en {ssid}, cuya subred es {cidr}, pero su dirección {ip} no está en ella.",
        "{a} hears {b} at {signal} dBm. A phone needs {limit} dBm or better for calls that do not break up.": "{a} recibe a {b} a {signal} dBm. Un teléfono necesita {limit} dBm o mejor para que las llamadas no se corten.",
        "{a} hears {b} at {signal} dBm, weaker than {limit} dBm: expect a slow link that drops. Move one closer, or add an access point.": "{a} recibe a {b} a {signal} dBm, más débil que {limit} dBm: espera un enlace lento que se cae. Acerca uno de los dos o añade un punto de acceso.",
        "{name} ({iface}) is on 2.4 GHz channel {ch}. Only 1, 6 and 11 stay clear of each other; a channel between them overlaps two.": "{name} ({iface}) está en el canal {ch} de 2.4 GHz. Solo 1, 6 y 11 no se pisan entre sí; un canal intermedio se superpone con dos.",
        "the subnet {net}": "la subred {net}",
        "{a} and {b} are both on {band} {ch} in {where}: they take turns on the same air and slow each other down.": "{a} y {b} están ambos en {band} {ch} en {where}: se turnan el mismo aire y se frenan entre sí.",
        "{a} ({chA}) and {b} ({chB}) overlap on {band} in {where}: they take turns on the same air and slow each other down.": "{a} ({chA}) y {b} ({chB}) se superponen en {band} en {where}: se turnan el mismo aire y se frenan entre sí.",
        "{ssid} is open: anyone in range can join it and read what it carries. Use WPA2/WPA3, or OWE (Enhanced Open) for a guest network.": "{ssid} está abierta: cualquiera dentro del alcance puede unirse y leer lo que transmite. Usa WPA2/WPA3, u OWE (Enhanced Open) para una red de invitados.",
        "{ssid} uses WEP, which free tools break in minutes. Use WPA2/WPA3.": "{ssid} usa WEP, que las herramientas gratuitas rompen en minutos. Usa WPA2/WPA3.",
        "{ssid} allows WPA (TKIP), which is retired and weak, and which Wi-Fi 6 devices will not use. Use WPA2/WPA3.": "{ssid} admite WPA (TKIP), que está retirado y es débil, y que los dispositivos Wi-Fi 6 no usan. Usa WPA2/WPA3.",
